/E (The Working Group operates as a cross-party, cross-sector forum that supports structured education, discussion and policy development and provides a trusted environment for informed, evidence-based decision-making. Its role is to ensure Parliament has access to independent, high-quality expertise as New Zealand defines its national position on blockchain and digital assets.)
