/E (This means virtual assets can be subject to proprietary rights, security interests, and tracing claims. Custodial and exchange arrangements may create trust relationships that carry fiduciary duties and govern shortfall allocation on insolvency. Personal property remedies such as conversion \(where applicable\), constructive trusts, and equitable proprietary claims may be available. As a result, virtual assets support full proprietary analysis rather than being treated as mere contractual expectations.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/S /H4
