/E (Reliable banking access underpins core business functions including payroll, fiat settlement, treasury management, and compliance. When access is unpredictable, firms face operational disruption, higher costs, and barriers to scale. Research from the World Bank and IMF shows that excluding compliant firms from domestic banking reduces regulatory visibility and pushes activity into less transparent jurisdictions.)
/K [5]
/Pg 25 0 R
/S /H3
